  "title": "HB 2019 (2007-2008 Regular Session (2008 action)): AN ACT concerning elections; amending K.S.A. 25-4502 and 25-4503 and K.S.A. 2007 Supp. 25-1122, 25-1123, 25-2908, 25-3002 and 25-4501 and repealing the existing sections.",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/historical_data/journals/2008/2008_H_Journal_0506.pdf",
